ne\nMedical Oncology\nSurgery\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExceptional Specialty Pet Care Close to Home\nYour pet is a part of your family, and we understand that facing a medical difficulty can be stressful. You can rely on our compassionate, expert team to make the process as easy as possible.\nMedVet Houston Bay is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. As a referral-only specialty center, we work closely with your family veterinarian to provide your pet with diagnostic expertise, sophisticated imaging, and specialized treatments and procedures. We work to deliver the best outcome for your pet, and you’ll get updates each step of the way to put your mind at ease.\nOur team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a longer, happy life.\nMedVet Houston Bay Area Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nEmily Medici, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nMedical Director\nStacey Aubin, CVPM\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nMax Banwell\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nTifini Batts\n, DVM, MSPH, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nBlaine Burkert\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nOlivia Geels\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nJenifer  Lunney\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology & SAIM)\nCardiology, Internal Medicine\nSihang (Cathay) Wu\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nPet Stories\n“\nOur cat Charlie almost died from a severe urinary blockage. The doctor saved his life with emergency surgery. Over a year later, he’s thriving with no medical issues. We’re so grateful to still have him with us. Thank you to MedVet for saving him – it means everything!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
